  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Using an exploit, users can force themselves to be added as your friend against your will. Muting or blocking them cannot prevent this, so a determined user can render themselves un-removable from your friends list as they will just keep re-adding themselves to your friends list.\n\nEven with a block or a mute, you must also remain on Orange or Red \"Ask Me\" status or they may join on you against your will and snoop on who you are with.\n\nIf more information is needed, I can give this privately.",
